        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 .5em;'>3 · 하루의 흐름</div><table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; table-layout:fixed; word-break:break-word; font-size:.8em; margin:.4em 0 .6em;'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>시각 (IST)</th><th style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>장면</th><th style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>무슨 일이 일어나는가</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>17:30</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>예측 실행</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>정오(UTC) 분석 자료 확보, 두 모델 실행 (약 10분)</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>18:00</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>저녁 경보</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>지점별 한 줄 메시지, 운영자 브리핑</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>22:00–08:00</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>정체 구간</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>혼합층 하강, 지표에 축적 → 민감군 리마인더</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>05:30</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>정점</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>가장 심한 시각, 교통 지점 최고</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>06:00</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>아침 업데이트</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>새 자료로 재실행, 등교·출근 전 발송</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>14:30</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>오후 숨 고르기</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>혼합층 상승, 환기·외출 가능한 창</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>사후</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>검증</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>공식 관측과 비교, 지점별 보정</td></tr></tbody></table><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b;'>그래프: Anand Vihar의 AQI와 혼합층. 파란 띠가 정체 시간(바람 10 km/h 미만, 혼합층 500 m 미만).</div></div>",
