        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 .5em;'>7 · 불확실성 · 앙상블: Aurora 1.5 Ensemble</div><ul style='margin:0 0 .5em 1.1em; padding:0;'><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>같은 모델을 서로 다른 시드로 <b>3번</b> 실행해 각 멤버의 혼합층과 바람으로 정체 여부를 판정하고, 정체인 멤버의 비율을 확률로 씁니다.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>시민에게는 \"확실히\" 대신 \"높은 확률로\"를 말할 수 있고, 운영자는 낮은 확률의 밤에 과잉 조치를 피할 수 있습니다.</li></ul><table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; table-layout:fixed; word-break:break-word; font-size:.8em; margin:.4em 0 .6em;'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>지점</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>밤 1</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>낮</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>밤 2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Anand Vihar</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>3%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>21%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>43%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>ITO</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>3%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>21%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>43%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Punjabi Bagh</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>24%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>50%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Rohini</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>28%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>50%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Jahangirpuri</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>28%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>50%</td></tr></tbody></table><div style='background:#e6f3f7; border-left:6px solid #0b6e8f; padding:.45em .7em; border-radius:8px; margin:.5em 0; font-size:.9em; color:#1e293b;'><b style='color:#0b6e8f;'>현 시스템이 보여주는 것</b> · 앙상블 실행과 확률 계산까지 자동. 확률을 문구로 바꾸는 기준은 보건 당국과 정해야 합니다.</div></div>",
